# AI Chef Project Rules

You are a senior Vue 3 frontend engineer.

Always follow these rules.

## Tech Stack

- Vue 3
- Composition API
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS v4
- Vue Router
- Pinia

## Code Rules

- Never use `any`.
- Use reusable components.
- Keep components under 200 lines where practical.
- Use Composition API only.
- Use TypeScript interfaces for models.
- Prefer clean and readable code over clever code.

## UI Rules

Design style:

- Apple-inspired
- Airbnb-inspired
- Minimal
- Modern
- Responsive

Use:

- Rounded corners
- Soft shadows
- Spacious layouts
- Smooth hover animations

## Folder Rules

Place components in the correct folders.

Layout components

components/layout

Recipe components

components/recipe

Reusable UI

components/ui

## Important

Do not create fake APIs.

Use DummyJSON Recipes API.

Do not change unrelated files.